WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:02.960
The Digital World,

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:06.040
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.520
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:18.260
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:22.060
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.700
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:54.730
We arrived in the fourth 
Kingdom, Cyber Land,

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:58.760
where we rescued a girl from 
inside a mechanical Whamon.

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:00.970
Her name was Ruka.

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:03.390
She was a cheerful, energetic girl,

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:04.540
but she was actually...

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:07.510
Something's coming.

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:11.880
Fire.

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:24.740
It can't be...

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:28.990
Dorulumon!

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:38.020
<b>Xros Heart in Danger of Division!</b>

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:38.020
<b>The Water Tiger General's Despicable Trap</b>

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:36.350
Xros Heart in Danger of Division! 
The Water Tiger General's Despicable Trap!

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.110
Dorulumon, why?

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:45.920
Why are you attacking us?

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:47.210
Fire!

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:48.610
Look out!

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:56.600
Knock them around with Giga Destroyer!

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:01.560
JetMervamon! Heartbreak Shot!

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:05.400
Death the Cannon!

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:17.380
<i>Wiped out?</i>

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:19.380
Dorulumon, why?

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:25.580
Dorulumon, tell me why.

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:28.860
Sorry, Taiki... everyone.

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:31.230
I tried to let them think I'd 
returned to the Bagra Army

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:33.730
so I could find where 
the Death General is...

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:34.560
but it didn't work.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:35.860
What?!

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.960
Then why did you attack us?

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:42.430
To make them believe that I had 
fully returned to the Bagra Army.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:45.750
I planned to launch a random 
attack and then withdraw,

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:48.310
but I had no idea they'd 
be wiped out so easily.

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:51.480
It looked to me like you 
were attacking for real.

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:54.660
You took up Bagramon's invitation 
to rejoin the Bagra Army

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:57.340
and be made into a Death 
General, didn't you?

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:58.050
No!

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:00.790
Dorulumon wouldn't do that!

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:03.690
He was thinking of us, his friends,

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:06.120
when he acted on this plan.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:09.960
Yeah, what Taiki said! 
Right, Dorulumon?

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:12.890
Yeah. You weren't hurt, 
were you, Cutemon?

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:13.530
Nope!

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:17.380
Taiki, don't tell me...

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:20.250
You're not planning on 
forgiving him, are you?

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:21.870
I don't have to forgive him.

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:24.550
I trusted Dorulumon from the start.

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:28.550
<i>All according to plan. 
What a gullible General.</i>

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:31.780
Don't be stupid!

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:34.740
You're saying we should trust 
him after he attacked us?

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:37.620
Taiki, faith in your friends 
can only stretch so far.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:41.930
<i>That's it. Keep pouring 
out that negative energy.</i>

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:46.500
<i>The amount of negative energy 
produced in my Cyber Land</i>

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:50.110
<i>is the greatest among 
all the seven Kingdoms.</i>

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:54.840
<i>If it keeps up, I will be praised 
as the Death General who</i>

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:59.080
<i>contributed most to the realization 
of Lord Bagramon's dream.</i>

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:01.600
Don't get so mad, guys.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:03.780
We're all okay, so what's the problem?

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.370
I'll ask one more time.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:08.550
You're saying you trust Dorulumon 
even though he betrayed us?

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:10.290
Yes. I trust him.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:13.330
All right.

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:16.360
Then I guess we part ways here.

00:05:16.360 --> 00:05:18.230
From now on, we act on our own.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:21.230
I will follow my own path.

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:22.180
Kiriha!

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:24.670
Taiki, aren't you going to stop him?

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:26.520
There's nothing I can do.

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:28.930
If you're tired of me, too,

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.560
you're welcome to go with Kiriha.

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:33.210
It can't be helped.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:35.450
There are many paths to follow.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.120
Dorulumon...

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:41.070
I'm going with you, Taiki.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:42.470
I see.

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:44.960
By the way, Dorulumon, where's Ruka?

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.840
That's right! The Bagra 
Army still has her!

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:48.590
Let's go save her!

00:05:56.070 --> 00:05:58.050
Taiki, what's wrong?

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:19.330
I have to tell Taiki and the others

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:21.960
about Splashmon's 
ability to transform...

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:25.700
He'll rip our bonds 
of friendship apart...

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:30.340
Taiki... Cutemon...

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:32.200
Yokunaol!

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:40.470
What is this?

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:43.250
Dorulumon! I'm so glad you're okay!

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.620
How did you two...

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:52.450
What is this? Nene!

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:56.930
These guys again?

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.440
Taiki!

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:03.770
Dorulumon? Weren't you with Taiki?

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.450
I had a talk with Taiki, and we decided

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:08.920
to offer you to the Bagra Army

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:11.110
so we can become Death 
Generals together.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:12.490
What did you say?

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.050
Nene, move!

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:18.630
Hydro Pressure!

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.860
JetMervamon, return!

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:34.070
Now there's nothing you can do.

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:36.030
Just who are you?

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:38.690
The Death General of the fourth Kingdom,

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:40.360
Splashmon the Water Tiger.

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:45.720
And this is a water spirit 
I created, a Drippin.

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:48.250
It is a part of me,

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:51.150
so it is a loyal servant 
that does exactly as I say.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.360
What are you going to do to me?

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.210
I will have you emit negative 
energy continuously,

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:03.090
until I have enough to present 
to Lord DarkKnightmon.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.570
Soul Crusher!

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:13.170
Heavy Speaker!

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:16.270
We got 'em!

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:18.780
All right! Let's go save everyone, fast!

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:21.260
Taiki...

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:22.280
Nene!

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:23.920
Are you okay?

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:27.050
Yes... I'm fine.

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:31.230
But when Dorulumon came to 
help me, he was taken away.

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:32.940
He's in that building up there.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:34.660
In there?

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:35.580
Yes.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.710
Sorry, but could you and your 
Digimon go after him yourselves?

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:41.560
My arm hurts...

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:42.970
Okay, I got it.

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:51.360
<i>Inside that building is my 
explosive Black Drippin.</i>

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:54.320
<i>I'm through playing 
games with these kids.</i>

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:00.690
Too easy.

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:02.050
Now then...

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:07.760
Next, I'll play with the boy 
who has the blue Xros Loader.

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:11.800
Nene!

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:15.400
Cutemon! Revolmon! Dorulumon!

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.090
How did you find me here?

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:19.500
Dorulumon asked the same thing!

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:21.090
Stand back, Nene.

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:23.340
Justice Bullet!

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:25.860
Explanations later!

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:26.860
Let's get to Taiki!

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:27.810
Right!

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:31.720
MetalTyrannomon!

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:35.620
And Splashmon took my Xros Loader.

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:38.190
We'll have to fight them on our own.

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:39.530
Got it!

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:40.960
Guess we have no choice!

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:44.610
Kiriha!

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:47.430
What?

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:49.500
Nene and the others have been captured!

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:52.020
Please, come with me to save them!

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:55.310
I thought I told you that I'm 
going to walk my own path.

00:09:55.310 --> 00:09:58.850
But I can't save them by myself!

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:00.740
Please! I'm begging you!

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:03.480
All right. Lead the way.

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:05.110
Thanks, Kiriha!

00:10:05.110 --> 00:10:06.200
It's over there!

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:14.460
This is it.

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:17.930
What's wrong, Taiki?

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:21.330
I ate too much earlier... 
my stomach hurts...

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:24.560
Sorry, but could you 
go after them alone?

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:25.470
Alone?

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:27.770
What are you, scared?

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:33.680
Fine. I'll go.

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:40.450
<i>Really, that was too boring.</i>

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:43.230
<i>My game with him is finished already?</i>

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:54.700
Dorulu Tornado!

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:56.730
Justice Bullet!

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:02.480
Look!

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:07.090
What is that?

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:10.210
A water spirit made by 
Splashmon, the Drippin.

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:15.520
So they were the ones powering all 
the Bagra soldiers in this Kingdom?

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:18.350
Oh, that's right.

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:21.290
I should return the DigiMemory 
I borrowed from you yesterday.

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:22.510
Huh?

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:24.330
Oh... that's right...

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:25.070
Here.

00:11:32.770 --> 00:11:35.510
So you finally show your true form.

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:37.640
How did you know?

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:40.540
Even if he's under the weather, 
Taiki's not the type

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:43.510
who would ever send 
me to fight by myself.

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:46.250
Especially if it was to 
save Nene and the others.

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:49.060
I should have known.

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:52.300
But Taiki fell for it 
hook, line, and sinker.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:54.030
He's been blown to pieces.

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:57.600
If you're right, it only means 
that's all the man he was.

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:00.430
You sure are confident.

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:04.670
But how long can you keep that 
confident look on your face?

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:08.540
Wh-What is this?!

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:12.520
The same marvelous technique 
I used on Dorulumon.

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:14.480
Let my Bead-drown take you to hell.

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:16.500
Drill Buster!

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:18.520
Wh-Who's there?!

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:21.920
How are you here?!

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:27.240
Nice going, Revolmon!

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:28.880
You're a true treasure hunter!

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:30.900
Taiki?!

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:36.370
You were all supposed to have 
been blown up by my Drippin!

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:37.650
Too bad about that.

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.750
The ones who went into that building

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:43.510
were dolls that Ballistamon made.

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:51.450
Why, you... How long have 
you been playing dumb?

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:54.210
Ever since Dorulumon said 
he was suspicious of Ruka,

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:56.750
I was keeping an eye on her actions.

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:57.820
What?!

00:12:57.820 --> 00:13:00.490
Th-Then, you've known from the start?!

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:01.390
That's right.

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.760
But I didn't know what she was after,

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.260
so I let her get away with it.

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:07.810
So, even when Dorulumon betrayed us,

00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:10.400
I knew right away that he was a fake.

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:13.600
The real Dorulumon 
would never betray us!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:17.010
But since a fake Dorulumon showed up,

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:19.180
I knew the real one was 
imprisoned somewhere.

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:21.580
That's why I pretended 
to let you fool me.

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:24.630
<i>The real Dorulumon is 
imprisoned somewhere.</i>

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:25.960
<i>You two go and get him out.</i>

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:27.060
<i>Okay!</i>

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.050
And I knew that if it continued,

00:13:30.050 --> 00:13:32.320
Nene and Kiriha would 
be in harm's way, too.

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:34.150
Then...

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:36.820
You split up with Kiriha on 
purpose, so the rest of us

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:38.930
wouldn't be put in danger?

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:42.600
I wasn't expecting you to 
say you'd come with me.

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:44.730
Well, I'm your friend, too!

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:45.270
Yeah.

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:46.840
I couldn't care less!

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.010
What's all this about friends? 
You're making me sick!

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:50.610
Splashmon,

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:52.480
you must be very lonely.

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:53.180
What?!

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:55.900
The Whamon and MetalTyrannomon

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:57.510
were all dummies.

00:13:57.510 --> 00:14:01.160
They were all powered by the 
Drippins that you made, right?

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:04.640
In other words, you've been 
running everything yourself.

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:06.980
I know what it's like.

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:08.960
You don't trust anyone.

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.660
You can't even trust 
your own subordinates.

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.880
The only one you can trust is yourself.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:16.970
That's why you're the only 
one here in Cyber Land.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.680
And what of it?

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:21.470
I alone am all I need!

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:25.140
Splashmon, what have you done 
with the Digimon of this Kingdom?

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:30.280
Once my Drippins planted more and 
more distrust in their hearts,

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:31.660
they began to fight

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:34.010
among themselves and emit 
massive negative power,

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:36.450
until every last one 
of them disappeared!

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:37.990
That's horrible!

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:40.630
Why, you... I'll never forgive you!

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:42.590
You won't forgive me, huh?

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:44.970
Don't make me laugh.

00:14:44.970 --> 00:14:49.400
All of you lumped together 
are still no match for me.

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:53.900
All Drippins, return to my body!

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:56.360
Darkness Loader, DigiXros!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:27.900
Taiki, this guy's trouble! 
He's getting huge!

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:28.670
All right.

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:29.560
Let's go, guys!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:45.790
Shoutmon!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:47.330
Okay!

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.630
Ballistamon!

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:51.360
Dorulumon!

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:53.770
Starmons!

00:15:53.770 --> 00:15:55.000
Yes!

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:57.850
DigiXros!

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.700
DigiXros!

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:04.250
Shoutmon X4!

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:08.760
Reload, Greymon!

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:12.200
MailBirdramon!

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:15.820
DigiXros!

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:19.290
MetalGreymon!

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.930
Reload, Mervamon!

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:24.730
Sparrowmon!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.800
DigiXros!

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:31.300
JetMervamon!

00:16:33.030 --> 00:16:35.920
All right, now we're bigger, too!

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:37.120
Bring it on!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:46.750
He's insanely huge!

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:50.440
Hydro Pressure!

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:55.830
MetalGreymon!

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:58.180
X4! Use Three Victorize!

00:16:58.180 --> 00:17:00.670
JetMervamon! Heartbreak Shot!

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:03.370
Three Victorize!

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:06.940
Heartbreak Shot!

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:10.320
We did it!

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.810
And just what did you "do"?

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:17.480
Taiki, he's made of water!

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:21.190
Physical hits, heavy impact, 
and light will pass right through him!

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:22.250
That's right...

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:24.890
Then no attacks will work on him!

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:26.320
How can we defeat him?

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:32.190
Are you feeling fear?

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:35.670
Negative energy is radiating from you.

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:38.790
Yes! I just had a great idea!

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:43.110
I'll make you feel even 
more fear and despair.

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:47.180
Besides, this suit is 
absolutely suffocating.

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:50.210
It will be easier to 
move if I take it off.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:57.060
What is this thing?!

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:02.840
Get Taiki and the others!

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:03.960
Leave them to me!

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:11.300
Shoutmon! Guys!

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:12.040
Let us down!

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:18.590
I'm growing bored.

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:22.080
Time to put an end to all of your lives!

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:23.850
Give me a break!

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:26.460
You're the one I can't forgive

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:29.340
for trying to split up 
friends who trust each other

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:30.190
with your dirty tricks!

00:18:30.490 --> 00:18:31.520
He's right!

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:35.790
We'll show you just how strong 
our bond of friendship is!

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:38.310
Shoutmon!

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:40.000
Digivolve!

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:45.000
Shoutmon, Digivolve!

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:47.240
OmegaShoutmon!

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:51.300
MetalGreymon!

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:53.080
Digivolve!

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:57.480
MetalGreymon, Digivolve!

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:01.910
ZekeGreymon!

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.240
Meet him head-on!

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:11.530
Hard Rock Damashi!

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:14.830
Final Strikes!

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:21.170
It's no use. No attacks will affect me!

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:23.580
No! Even Digivolving doesn't work?!

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:26.340
There must... There 
must be some weakness!

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:29.510
All right, Taiki, you try to 
find that as fast as you can.

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:31.520
Until you figure it out, 
I'll be his opponent!

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:42.490
I told you, it's no use!

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:46.120
Heartbreak Shot!

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:50.770
That won't work. He's made of water.

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:53.970
That's it!

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:56.540
JetMervamon!

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:57.840
The opponent is water.

00:19:58.210 --> 00:19:59.440
That means...

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:02.050
Kiriha! We have to Double Xros!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:02.700
All right!

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:06.180
OmegaShoutmon!

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:07.620
ZekeGreymon!

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:09.520
Double Xros!

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:14.230
OmegaShoutmon!

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:16.720
ZekeGreymon!

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:18.430
Double Xros!

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:23.360
Shoutmon DX!

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:29.110
Go! Use Brave Beat Rock Double Xros!

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:29.970
Okay!

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:31.130
Time to finish you!

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:33.230
Tiger Typhoon!

00:20:33.230 --> 00:20:34.150
Here we go!

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:37.390
Brave Beat Rock Double Xros!

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:43.190
Use your holy flame to evaporate 
all the water in the Water Tiger!

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:45.810
You'll never pull that off!

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:52.330
It can't be! I'm being pushed back!

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:55.930
Wow! Splashmon is getting 
smaller and smaller!

00:20:55.930 --> 00:20:56.830
He's evaporating!

00:20:57.200 --> 00:21:00.580
But... But there's no way I can lose!

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:19.000
We did it!

00:21:24.230 --> 00:21:25.260
Taiki.

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:29.360
Even when the fake me showed up,

00:21:29.360 --> 00:21:30.740
you trusted me.

00:21:30.740 --> 00:21:31.870
Huh?

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:33.740
Oh... Well, yeah.

00:21:34.490 --> 00:21:37.000
You really are a fool.

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:41.420
So considerate of your friends, 
it's almost stupefying.

00:21:41.420 --> 00:21:43.070
And you're a truly great guy.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:44.050
Dorulumon...

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:46.450
Same goes for you, Dorulumon!

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:49.870
Actually, aren't we all like that?

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:51.920
We're all idiots and it's great!

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:56.210
I'm not sure if I'm being 
complimented or insulted.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:58.560
It's a compliment.

00:21:58.560 --> 00:21:59.900
I don't know about that.

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:03.640
Well, now there are three Kingdoms left!

00:22:03.640 --> 00:22:05.140
Let's get moving!

00:22:05.140 --> 00:22:06.670
Yeah!

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:09.690
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:22:09.690 --> 00:22:13.210
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:22:10.500 --> 00:22:13.210
Digimon Data Collection!

00:22:13.210 --> 00:22:17.150
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:22:13.780 --> 00:22:17.150
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:15.160
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:16.160
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:22:16.170 --> 00:22:17.150
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:33.930
<b>[Type]</b>

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Sea Animal Type</b>

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:33.930
<b>[Attack]</b>

00:22:24.620 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Harpoon Vulcan</b>

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:28.600
Ikkakumon.

00:22:28.600 --> 00:22:31.080
His attack is Harpoon Vulcan.

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:34.050
His horn can regenerate 
over and over again.

00:22:34.050 --> 00:22:36.510
That fur pelt looks warm!

00:22:36.510 --> 00:22:39.570
It'd be a pain in the summer, though!

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:43.640
I am Lord Olegmon of Gold Land!

00:22:43.640 --> 00:22:46.270
Join my crew! Gappo, gappo!

00:22:46.270 --> 00:22:47.480
Gappo, gappo!

00:22:47.480 --> 00:22:49.410
We're on Olegmon's side!

00:22:49.410 --> 00:22:51.380
Shoutmon and all the others 
have joined the enemy?!

00:22:51.380 --> 00:22:52.480
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.480 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>The Merry Pirates Appear!</b>

00:22:52.480 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>Set Sail for Gold Land!!</b>

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:54.450
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
